# Godot import sidecars.
# Safe today: the only ones generated are for prototyping-resources/, which holds
# concept art, not game assets. The vendored addons/gut/ ones are already tracked
# and stay tracked — .gitignore does not untrack anything.
#
# REVISIT WHEN assets/ FILLS UP: for real game assets a .import file carries the
# resource UID, and dropping it means every clone regenerates its own, which can
# break scene references. At that point narrow this to prototyping-resources/*.import
# and commit the ones under assets/.
*.import
